0.10.0-alpha.4:
  Add appliance load simulation and power profiling to virtual sensors.
  Support linked switches with automatic 0W power cut behavior.
  Add recurring scheduled duty cycles (clock-aligned e.g. 10 mins hourly) for water heaters and cyclic appliances.
  Add virtual.run_cycle and virtual.set_load services for testing and AppDaemon automations.
  Expose load_state, control_mode, cycle_active, and cycle_remaining in sensor state attributes.
  Add auto-off timeouts (off_delay) and entity gating (linked_entity) to binary sensors (motion, sound, occupancy).
  Enhance virtual.turn_on service with optional duration parameter for pulsing binary sensors.
  Add closed-loop thermal HVAC simulation engine modeling house leakage, outdoor ambient weather, and staged heating/cooling.
  Synchronize indoor temperature and HVAC power consumption across linked sensor entities.
  Add virtual.set_sim_speed service for accelerated thermal test automation.
  Update Virtual Device Editor with thermal simulation settings and Thermal House HVAC template.
0.10.0-alpha.3:
  Add virtual camera platform with snapshot image and live stream playback.
  Support Picture Entity Cards with remote HTTP/HTTPS image URLs or local files.
  Provide default Mux Big Buck Bunny HLS test stream for live camera testing.
  Add embedded fallback offline JPEG placeholder.
  Add virtual.set_image_url and virtual.set_stream_url services.
  Update Virtual Device Editor with camera platform support and Security Camera template.
0.10.0-alpha.2:
  Add virtual media_player platform with volume, mute, source selection, and silent TTS / play_media testing.
  Add virtual climate platform with target setpoints, presets, dynamic hvac_action calculation, and virtual.set_current_temperature service.
  Add virtual alarm_control_panel platform with PIN codes, exit/entry delays, and arm/disarm/trigger services.
  Add virtual button platform (`button.press`).
  Add virtual select platform (`select.select_option`).
  Add virtual text platform (`text.set_value`).
  Update Virtual Device Editor with support for media_player, climate, alarm_control_panel, button, select, and text platforms and templates.
0.10.0-alpha.1:
  Fix lock entity hanging when locking_time is configured.
  Fix AttributeError in lock async_open.
  Ensure immediate state update and write across light, switch, fan, and number entities.
  Modernize sensor and number platforms to inherit from SensorEntity and NumberEntity.
  Avoid duplicating native entity properties into extra_state_attributes.
  Harden state restoration against None/stale values across restarts.
  Fix service registration dictionary lookup bug across multiple platforms.
  Use Home Assistant Store and non-blocking I/O for device tracker state persistence.
  Eliminate aiofiles dependency in favor of standard executor file handling.
  Python 3.12 modernization: add future annotations, explicit imports, clean legacy code.
  Update documentation and translations for numbers platform and services.
